sequenceDiagram
  participant M as Merchant
  participant A as API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant W as Worker
  participant P as Provider simulator
  M->>A: POST payment with idempotency key
  A->>D: Begin; key, payment, operation, outbox, response
  D-->>A: Commit
  A-->>M: 202 with stable resource ID
  W->>D: Claim operation with lease and fencing token
  D-->>W: Claim committed
  W->>P: Capture with stable provider key
  P->>P: Persist successful capture
  Note over P,W: Response may be lost
  W->>D: Mark UNKNOWN if timeout
  W->>P: Query or retry same operation key
  P-->>W: Authoritative capture success
  W->>D: Begin; verify lease; state and balanced ledger and outbox
  D-->>W: Commit once by business reference
